    `A was a member of the same household as B` IS TRUE
    `A had frequent contact with B at the time of that act` IS TRUE
    `at that time there was a significant risk of grievous hurt being caused to B by the unlawful act of such a person` IS TRUE
    `A was the person whose act caused B's death` IS TRUE
    `A was, or ought to have been, aware of the significant risk` IS TRUE
    `A failed to take such steps as A could reasonably have been expected to take to protect B from the significant risk` IS TRUE
    `the unlawful act occurred in circumstances of the kind that A foresaw or ought to have foreseen` IS TRUE
    `A could not have been expected in A's circumstances to take any such step` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `offence under s 304C(4)` `Household death, both alternatives of (1)(d)`
-- s 308A(2), with the Illustration
-- Illustration: three members of a group including A decide to rob a neighbourhood shop. The group leader B brings a sharp knife but reassures A that the knife is only
-- to be used to threaten the shopkeeper C. A believes B and takes part. B then stabs C, who dies. "A is guilty of an offence under this section because A knew that the
-- knife was to be used to threaten another person, C, in furtherance of the group's common object to commit robbery."
-- A did not know that death or grievous hurt was likely; A knew a deadly weapon was to be used against another person.
`Group object death, the knife Illustration` MEANS `Group Object Death Facts` WITH
    `particulars` IS `the particulars`
    `victim` IS "C"
    `victim described as` IS ""
    `the manner` IS "B stabbed the said C with a knife in the course of a robbery"
    `the accused is or acts as a member of a group` IS TRUE
    `the accused knows that the common object of the members of the group is to commit an offence under this Code or any written law` IS TRUE
    `the accused knows that death or grievous hurt is likely to be caused in furtherance of the group's common object` IS FALSE
    `the accused knows that a deadly weapon, or anything which, used as a weapon of offence, is likely to cause death, is to be used in any manner against another person in the furtherance of that common object` IS TRUE
    `the death of a person was caused in furtherance of the group's common object` IS TRUE

#ASSERT `offence under s 308A(2)` `Group object death, the knife Illustration`
#ASSERT (`charge under s 308A(2)` `Group object death, the knife Illustration`)'s `made out`
#ASSERT (`charge under s 308A(2)` `Group object death, the knife Illustration`)'s punishment EQUALS "imprisonment for life or imprisonment for a term which may extend to 20 years, and shall also be liable to caning"
#ASSERT (`charge under s 308A(2)` `Group object death, the knife Illustration`)'s text EQUALS "You, Tan Ah Kow, are charged that you, on or about the 1st day of March 2025, at about 9.30 pm, at Block 123 Ang Mo Kio Avenue 3, Singapore, being or acting as a member of a group, knowing that the common object of the members of the group was to commit an offence, and knowing that a deadly weapon, or anything which, used as a weapon of offence, is likely to cause death, was to be used against another person in the furtherance of that common object, did, the death of one C having been caused in furtherance of that common object, to wit, B stabbed the said C with a knife in the course of a robbery, and you have thereby committed an offence punishable under section 308A(2) of the Penal Code 1871."
-- the other limb of (b): knowledge that death or grievous hurt is likely
`Group object death, death likely` MEANS `Group Object Death Facts` WITH
    `particulars` IS `the particulars`
    `victim` IS "C"
    `victim described as` IS ""
    `the manner` IS "B stabbed the said C"
    `the accused is or acts as a member of a group` IS TRUE
    `the accused knows that the common object of the members of the group is to commit an offence under this Code or any written law` IS TRUE
    `the accused knows that death or grievous hurt is likely to be caused in furtherance of the group's common object` IS TRUE
    `the accused knows that a deadly weapon, or anything which, used as a weapon of offence, is likely to cause death, is to be used in any manner against another person in the furtherance of that common object` IS FALSE
    `the death of a person was caused in furtherance of the group's common object` IS TRUE

