    `the harm inflicted was no more than it was reasonably necessary to inflict in the circumstances` IS FALSE
    `there was no reasonable opportunity to have recourse to the protection of a public authority in the circumstances` IS FALSE
    `the act causes the defender to reasonably believe that death or grievous hurt would result` IS FALSE
    `the act is not done or attempted by a public servant acting in good faith under the actual or apparent authority of his office` IS FALSE
